      "source": "玩家观点",
      "polarity": "需留意",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "excerpt": "I thought there would be like a boss fight at the end or something. Its just put the fire out and that's it.",
          "url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198191089909/recommended/3648730/",
          "label": "证据原文片段"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "玩法单一导致很快失去新鲜感",
